00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.480
way to get compliance from the people he wanted
to get compliance from.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:49.560
Now he's threatening people with prison because
he's president of the United States.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:55.980
It is truly chilling to see him wave prison
time around to reporters in this way.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:01.510
And I know that there will be Trumpess who
see this and say, David, it was a vague threat.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:04.410
He's generally talking about prison.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:11.120
Freedom of the press is one of the most important,
uh, uh, speech freedoms that we have in this

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.170
country.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:19.480
And a president threatening or even mentioning
prison to a reporter in this way is unheard

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:24.830
of except in extremely authoritarian dictatorial
circles.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.430
And that is exactly what Donald Trump aspires
to.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.230
And that's why this is so chilling in dangerous.

